 first encounter 2-0, and scored early in the second game. " [:a {:href "/athletes/26784"} "Espeseth"] " and Gulbrandsen then pulled Norway into the lead, only to see " [:a {:href "/athletes/27681"} "Tiffeny Milbrett"] " score in the dying seconds of the match. As in their semi-final encounter in 1996, the match went into sudden death overtime. After 12 minutes, a pass by " [:a {:href "/athletes/26790"} "Hege Riise"] " bounced off the arm of " [:a {:href "/athletes/90939"} "Dagny Mellgren"] ", who then picked up the ball and scored the golden goal. The Americans protested the hands ball, but Canadian referee Sonia Denoncourt ruled it unintentional and hence legal."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button551507", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button551507').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Goals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Yellow Cards"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Red Cards"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Penalty Kicks"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Shots"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Shots on Goal"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Corner Kicks"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Free Kicks"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Offsides"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Fouls Committed"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {:class "accordion-toggle", :data-toggle "collapse", :data-target ".team-members-489278"} [:div {:class "glyphicon glyphicon-plus"}]] [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} "Norway"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NOR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NOR.png"}] "NOR"]] [:td {:class "split", :style "di